# AI Prompt — Phase 3: Communication Module + Invoice Email Delivery

We are building an enterprise accounting system using Java Spring Boot.

The Document Rendering Engine is complete.

Now implement a reusable **Communication Module** responsible for sending emails, tracking delivery, managing email configuration, and integrating with Invoice workflows.

Do NOT put email logic inside the Invoice module.

