## 1. MailConfiguration

Purpose:

Store SMTP configuration per business/company.

Fields:

```
id

companyId

provider

smtpHost

smtpPort

username

encryptedPassword

fromEmail

fromName

useTls

active

createdAt

updatedAt
```

