# 2. EmailLog

Every outgoing email must be recorded.

Fields:

```
id

companyId

entityType

entityId

recipient

subject

status

providerMessageId

sentAt

failedReason

createdAt
```

---

Status:

```
PENDING

SENDING

SENT

FAILED
```

---

Example:

```
entityType:

INVOICE


entityId:

100


recipient:

customer@gmail.com


status:

SENT
```

