# Invoice Email Service

Create this in the Invoice module:

```
InvoiceEmailService
```

Responsibilities:

It coordinates invoice sending.

It should NOT send emails directly.

---

Method:

```java
sendInvoice(Long invoiceId)
```

Flow:

```
Load Invoice

↓

Validate invoice

↓

Ensure invoice can be sent

(status must be DRAFT)

↓

Generate PDF

↓

Create EmailMessage

↓

Publish Email Event

↓

Return response
```

---

