# Invoice Status Handling

Sending email should transition:

```
DRAFT

    |
    |
    send invoice

    ▼

SENT
```

But:

Email delivery status is separate.

Example:

```
Invoice:

SENT


Email:

FAILED
```

The invoice was still issued.

